/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 289 0 R
/E (At the prototype stage \(our previous evaluation\) we had a working backend with the core booking logic and a very basic one-page HTML front end. This report describes the final version, in which we rebuilt the front end in React, added the features that were missing \(cancellation, notifications and reminders, dashboards for every role, user management\), fixed the problems we found in the prototype, and tested the whole system much more thoroughly.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
