670 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 300 0 R
/E (For the reminders, a small background job runs every minute and looks for con- firmed appointments starting in the next 60 minutes that have not had a reminder yet. It marks each booking as reminded in the same transaction, so a reminder is never sent twice. In the app, a bell icon shows the number of unread notifications and checks for new ones every 30 seconds. Users can mark one or all notifications as read.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
671 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 300 0 R
/E (We also wrote code to send the same notifications by email. Email is only switched on if the server is given mail server \(SMTP\) settings. We did not have an SMTP server to test with, so email is switched off by default and the in-app notifications work on their own.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [13]
>>
